{#-
  update_report.txt.j2

  Rendered ONCE, at 0600. There is deliberately no masked counterpart.

  This report pairs hostnames with the exact packages still outstanding on
  each one, which together describe what is exploitable where. There is no
  audience for a redacted version of that, and shipping one would invite the
  file to be forwarded. Compare listener_report.txt.j2, which does dual-
  render because a masked socket sweep is genuinely useful to circulate.

  INPUT: host_rows_list -- see tasks/build_host_rows.yml.
-#}
================================================================================
PACKAGE UPDATE RUN
Generated {{ report_generated }} UTC

UNMASKED. Contains hostnames and outstanding package versions. Do not forward.
================================================================================

SUMMARY
  Hosts in scope    {{ host_rows_list | length }}
  Processed         {{ host_rows_list | selectattr('reachable') | list | length }}
  Not processed     {{ host_rows_list | rejectattr('reachable') | list | length }}

  Checks PASS       {{ host_rows_counts.PASS }}
  Checks FAIL       {{ host_rows_counts.FAIL }}
  Checks SKIP       {{ host_rows_counts.SKIP }}

  A SKIP is NOT a pass. The upgrade was not attempted on that host, so its
  package state is unknown rather than current.

{% for row in host_rows_list | sort(attribute='name') %}
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
{{ row.name }}  [{{ row.verdict }}]
{% if not row.reachable %}
  NOT PROCESSED -- {{ row.reason | default('no session established') }}
{#- No counts. "0 packages outstanding" for a host nobody reached renders as
    a measurement and reads as the best-patched machine in the fleet.
    See docs/gotchas.md entry 3. -#}
  No upgrade was attempted. This host's package state is unknown, not current.
{% else %}
{% for check in row.checks %}
  {{ '%-6s' | format(check.status) }} {{ check.check }}
{%- if check.status != 'PASS' %}
           expected: {{ check.expected | default('') }}
           actual:   {{ check.actual | default('') }}
{% if check.reason | default('') %}           reason:   {{ check.reason | trim }}
{% endif %}
{%- endif %}
{% else %}
  No checks were produced for this host.
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
